sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant Socket8080
  participant TomcatThread as Tomcat Thread (T1)
  participant Dispatcher as DispatcherServlet (T1)
  participant RestController as @RestController (T1)

  Client->>Socket8080: HTTP Request (R1)
  Socket8080->>TomcatThread: Assign thread T1
  TomcatThread->>Dispatcher: Dispatch request (T1)
  Dispatcher->>RestController: Call controller (T1)
  RestController-->>TomcatThread: Return response (T1)
  TomcatThread-->>Socket8080: Send response (T1)
  Socket8080-->>Client: HTTP Response (R1)